WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 29=

01:39.620 --> 01:41.820
(Prince of Jin's Residence)

01:50.840 --> 01:52.310
Look at that sweet little face!

01:53.150 --> 01:54.480
Sleeping so peacefully!

01:56.120 --> 01:56.590
Lingyi.

01:57.760 --> 01:58.400
Come here.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.480
Dear Chunhua,

02:05.510 --> 02:07.510
you've done so much for my baby and me.

02:09.560 --> 02:09.960
Lingyi.

02:10.120 --> 02:10.680
- Come on.
- The baby's asleep.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.360
Say goodbye to Aunt Chunhua.

02:13.190 --> 02:13.680
Lingyi!

02:14.280 --> 02:14.750
Lingyi!

02:15.310 --> 02:15.840
Your Highness!

02:16.280 --> 02:16.870
Your Highness!

02:22.910 --> 02:23.960
Your Highness!

02:25.190 --> 02:26.430
Your Highness!

02:32.630 --> 02:33.590
Your Highness!

02:34.400 --> 02:36.150
Your Highness!

02:39.030 --> 02:40.800
Your Highness!

03:03.660 --> 03:06.300
(Drunken Immortal Tavern)

03:10.500 --> 03:12.540
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

03:17.900 --> 03:20.140
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

03:23.170 --> 03:24.470
(Jiang Heng, Military Governor
of Lingnan)

03:24.470 --> 03:26.280
Yan Shang, Collator at Hongwen Hall.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.560
Have you heard of him?

03:31.000 --> 03:31.910
Never heard of him.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.150
He may be a capital official,

03:34.630 --> 03:36.710
but isn't he just some scribe
at the academy?

03:37.120 --> 03:39.000
I seem to recall

03:39.630 --> 03:41.280
that he placed among the top three

03:41.800 --> 03:43.000
in last year's imperial examinations.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.190
An upright scholar-official.

03:49.190 --> 03:50.150
Did he say why he's here?

03:51.150 --> 03:52.960
He says he's from this region

03:53.030 --> 03:54.800
and came to pay his respects
while visiting family.

04:05.280 --> 04:06.120
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

04:06.120 --> 04:06.520
My apologies.

04:06.870 --> 04:08.030
The governor is busy with business.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.030
He can't receive you right now.

04:09.400 --> 04:09.800
Please forgive us.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.280
You'll have to leave.

04:12.870 --> 04:13.430
I see.

04:14.870 --> 04:15.280
No matter.

04:16.920 --> 04:17.390
Thank you anyway.

04:24.980 --> 04:28.489
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

04:28.531 --> 04:29.559
High-ranking officials are hard to meet.

04:29.601 --> 04:31.241
(Drunken Immortal Tavern)
Shall we head home and rest, sir?

04:33.190 --> 04:34.270
If we can't see the big officials,

04:34.630 --> 04:35.680
we'll see the lesser ones.

04:36.480 --> 04:38.920
Surely they won't all turn us away.

04:40.070 --> 04:40.390
Come on.

04:41.070 --> 04:41.600
Let's go to the County Office.

04:43.510 --> 04:44.289
My lord! My lord!

04:44.331 --> 04:45.349
May you live a hundred years!

04:45.390 --> 04:46.859
May you live a hundred years, my lord!

04:46.901 --> 04:49.229
May you live a hundred years!
Bless you, my lord!

04:49.271 --> 04:49.621
Get up!

04:49.670 --> 04:51.599
My lord, please give us something
to eat!

04:51.641 --> 04:54.159
Please! Just a little food!

04:54.201 --> 04:55.069
Please!

04:55.111 --> 04:56.799
Please, my lord!

04:56.841 --> 04:57.919
Just a little food!

04:57.961 --> 05:00.359
May you live a hundred years!
Bless you!

05:00.401 --> 05:01.829
Please give us something to eat!

05:01.871 --> 05:03.111
Just a bite, please!

05:03.300 --> 05:03.609
Well,

05:03.651 --> 05:05.021
you must be exhausted
from your journey, my boy.

05:05.720 --> 05:07.720
When did you arrive
in our humble county?

05:08.920 --> 05:09.240
Oh, by the way,

05:09.830 --> 05:11.360
how has your father been?

05:13.070 --> 05:13.630
Thanks for asking.

05:14.070 --> 05:14.920
He's doing well.

05:15.720 --> 05:17.950
You seem to be in excellent health
yourself.

05:19.190 --> 05:19.630
(Zheng Chengqing, County Magistrate)
Not bad.

05:20.360 --> 05:20.870
Not bad at all.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.560
Come, my boy.

05:27.750 --> 05:29.950
Last year, I happened to pass
by the County Office

05:31.120 --> 05:33.310
and saw you
seeing Captain Zhang Renjing out.

05:34.190 --> 05:36.430
He looked well fed
and had plenty to drink.

05:37.560 --> 05:38.480
I assume

05:38.920 --> 05:40.190
you entertained him here.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.070
What a coincidence!

05:42.600 --> 05:43.950
It seems you

05:44.510 --> 05:45.870
know Captain Zhang too.

05:46.480 --> 05:47.120
More than that.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.040
We know each other very well.

05:48.870 --> 05:50.459
Speaking of Captain Zhang,

05:50.501 --> 05:52.181
he must have had
his ancestors' blessings.

05:52.510 --> 05:53.510
He rose through the ranks so quickly.

05:54.070 --> 05:55.040
But I heard

05:55.390 --> 05:57.800
he owed his rise
to that treacherous eunuch.

05:58.310 --> 05:59.800
Now that the eunuch has fallen,

05:59.870 --> 06:02.270
I wonder what became of Captain Zhang.

06:02.560 --> 06:03.310
I know.

06:04.120 --> 06:04.680
He's dead.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.270
Dead?

06:10.950 --> 06:11.920
I killed him.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.800
I haven't had a chance to tell you.

06:25.390 --> 06:26.560
On this visit home,

06:27.270 --> 06:28.800
I did use visiting family as a pretext.

06:29.360 --> 06:29.920
But actually,

06:31.000 --> 06:31.920
(Circuit Inspector)
I'm here on official business.

06:37.310 --> 06:38.720
I see you recognize this.

06:39.190 --> 06:39.680
Excellent.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.630
That saves me an explanation.

06:42.040 --> 06:42.720
Forgive my ignorance.

06:42.800 --> 06:44.430
May I ask what brings
the Circuit Inspector

06:45.040 --> 06:45.720
to our county?

06:47.070 --> 06:47.920
Now that Yu's faction has fallen,

06:48.190 --> 06:49.720
the court must restore order.

06:50.310 --> 06:52.160
Even a remote place like Santu County

06:52.630 --> 06:53.310
is still imperial territory.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.680
Every official must
be thoroughly investigated

06:56.240 --> 06:57.800
if we're to make a fresh start.

07:00.360 --> 07:01.160
I'm afraid

07:01.950 --> 07:04.000
some officials
will lose their positions.

07:05.510 --> 07:06.120
Or perhaps

07:07.800 --> 07:08.800
their heads.

07:10.950 --> 07:12.240
Your Excellency! Please spare my life!

07:12.560 --> 07:13.190
At least

07:13.560 --> 07:16.310
for the sake of my old friendship
with your father...

07:16.390 --> 07:18.600
My father was unfortunately
driven into the wilderness.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.160
Not only did he lose
his household registration,

07:20.600 --> 07:22.430
but he's apparently not even
a whole man anymore.

07:26.160 --> 07:27.070
Those words...

07:28.040 --> 07:29.830
You said them yourself back then,
didn't you?

07:36.120 --> 07:38.270
I'm the sort of man
who never lets a slight go.

07:38.920 --> 07:39.720
You really

07:40.560 --> 07:42.480
should've watched your mouth that day.

07:42.680 --> 07:43.678
I deserve to die!

07:43.720 --> 07:44.720
I deserve to die!

07:44.920 --> 07:45.950
Forgive me, please!

07:48.630 --> 07:50.000
You've been an official for many years.

07:50.750 --> 07:53.560
Surely you know how much authority
a Circuit Inspector holds.

07:54.240 --> 07:56.240
As the Emperor's inspector
of Lingnan Circuit,

07:56.510 --> 07:57.720
I may not be able
to touch military governors

07:58.120 --> 07:59.430
or prefects so easily.

08:00.630 --> 08:02.190
But taking a county magistrate's life?

08:03.040 --> 08:05.040
All it takes is one more report
to the throne.

08:06.120 --> 08:08.830
I wonder if the cases
you've handled over the years

08:09.870 --> 08:11.720
could withstand such scrutiny.

08:11.830 --> 08:13.430
Have mercy, Your Excellency!

08:14.430 --> 08:16.950
I'll... I'll crawl
on my knees to your home

08:17.240 --> 08:18.539
and apologize to your father!

08:18.581 --> 08:21.021
Please spare my miserable life!

08:24.360 --> 08:25.480
There is one way.

08:25.870 --> 08:26.680
The question is,

08:27.390 --> 08:29.310
are you willing to do me a favor?

08:30.310 --> 08:31.430
Yes! Of course!

08:32.120 --> 08:33.150
Anything you ask!

08:33.840 --> 08:35.390
Bring me the county's financial records.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.720
As for any injustices or illegal acts,

08:52.630 --> 08:53.630
even if you weren't responsible,

08:55.030 --> 08:56.240
someone else surely was.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.600
I trust you'll

09:03.000 --> 09:03.960
tell me everything you know.

09:04.840 --> 09:06.320
Make a list of everyone involved

09:07.910 --> 09:08.870
and what they did.

09:09.600 --> 09:10.320
I'll be

09:11.030 --> 09:13.440
most grateful for your help.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.120
(Prince of Jin's Residence)
Your Highness!

09:26.320 --> 09:27.870
(Virtue Shines)
Your Highness!

09:30.750 --> 09:34.390
Please give me back my baby,
Your Highness!

09:34.790 --> 09:37.790
We've given her the finest food
and lodging every day.

09:38.390 --> 09:40.000
Why is she crying like that?

09:41.030 --> 09:42.600
How strange!

09:43.670 --> 09:44.200
Indeed.

09:44.550 --> 09:46.200
Everyone knows how kind you are,
Your Highness.

09:50.870 --> 09:51.390
Never mind.

09:52.790 --> 09:53.750
It's only right.

09:54.600 --> 09:55.960
After all, my child

09:56.270 --> 09:57.720
happened to be born from her womb.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.120
Your Highness!

09:59.320 --> 10:01.000
She doesn't even have to nurse the baby,

10:01.270 --> 10:02.360
or lift a finger.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.150
Yet she's still ungrateful.

10:05.150 --> 10:07.840
Thank you for coming personally
to bring gifts for the little prince.

10:08.390 --> 10:09.630
Your Highness!

10:11.720 --> 10:15.270
Please give me back my baby!

10:24.670 --> 10:26.120
Your Highness!

10:27.840 --> 10:31.080
Please give me back my baby!

10:34.080 --> 10:34.790
Attendant Liu.

10:41.080 --> 10:41.550
Attendant Liu,

10:42.000 --> 10:44.000
this register lists the traitor's
remaining followers

10:44.080 --> 10:45.910
whose offenses were minor
or whose guilt couldn't be proven.

10:57.620 --> 10:59.660
(Liang Yuanhui)

11:01.840 --> 11:03.270
Please advise us, Attendant Liu.

11:03.670 --> 11:05.200
If any of the traitors
have escaped justice,

11:05.840 --> 11:06.910
His Majesty may be displeased.

11:08.000 --> 11:08.790
We'll investigate thoroughly.

11:09.030 --> 11:09.630
Every last one!

11:24.400 --> 11:25.538
(This year: 38 people lost, 10 fled,
9 killed in battle, 6 lost at sea;)

11:25.539 --> 11:26.360
(many sugar-trading ships
diverted to Rongzhou.)

11:39.960 --> 11:41.640
(Revised land-allotment records: 450
qing allocated across the townships.)

11:45.120 --> 11:45.880
(Shanwei: 8 qing of farmland destroyed.
Current registered households.)

11:56.280 --> 11:57.960
(Zhao Shi extorted villagers.
Registrar Li Jie embezzled labor funds.)

12:01.240 --> 12:03.080
(Wang Jia: Arrests made, cases dropped.
Wei Feng, Senior Secretary,)

12:08.240 --> 12:09.630
Wei Feng, Senior Secretary

12:10.120 --> 12:10.750
(falsely drew military supplies.)
of the Fifth Rank,

12:11.960 --> 12:13.240
falsely drew military supplies.

12:16.320 --> 12:16.720
Someone!

12:25.320 --> 12:26.080
(Chen Da, Bailiff of Santu County)
At your service, sir.

12:32.340 --> 12:34.580
(Wei Feng,
Senior Secretary of the Fifth Rank)

12:37.670 --> 12:38.080
Oh my...

12:38.840 --> 12:39.390
That young fellow...

12:39.550 --> 12:41.320
He's actually a Circuit Inspector!

12:41.390 --> 12:42.270
He's got some nerve!

12:42.670 --> 12:44.150
He's already summoned
Senior Secretary Wei for questioning!

12:45.870 --> 12:46.510
- Prefect!
- Prefect!

12:46.670 --> 12:49.120
Prefect, who exactly is this man?

12:49.320 --> 12:50.790
What are we going to do?

12:50.910 --> 12:52.000
Don't panic.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.390
But I've heard

12:58.150 --> 12:59.840
he's got a list of names

13:00.200 --> 13:01.960
(Wei Feng, Senior Secretary of Shaozhou)
and plans to question everyone on it.

13:02.270 --> 13:02.840
I...

13:03.480 --> 13:05.320
I'm just the first.

13:05.550 --> 13:05.840
What?

13:06.670 --> 13:07.150
Prefect, what...

13:07.750 --> 13:08.320
Quiet.

13:09.270 --> 13:11.480
I've already looked into his background.

13:12.670 --> 13:14.600
He's a nobody from the countryside,
with no connections.

13:15.510 --> 13:18.240
His Majesty was probably short of men
after Yu's downfall,

13:18.720 --> 13:19.960
so he promoted this man.

13:20.600 --> 13:21.480
Then why

13:22.150 --> 13:23.630
send him here of all places?

13:26.150 --> 13:27.360
Could he already have...

13:34.000 --> 13:36.030
Sir, the military governor
has sent for you.

13:38.750 --> 13:40.480
The Circuit Inspector has already
arrived in Santu County.

13:40.910 --> 13:41.630
How do you

13:42.360 --> 13:43.240
intend to handle him?

13:44.200 --> 13:46.150
We're discussing that very matter.

13:46.600 --> 13:49.550
I heard that before summoning
the local officials,

13:49.960 --> 13:51.240
he visited the Santu County office.

13:51.720 --> 13:53.000
But someone told me

13:53.630 --> 13:55.000
that before meeting Magistrate Zheng,

13:55.670 --> 13:56.870
he visited your residence.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.510
Yes, yes, he did.

13:58.670 --> 13:58.960
Well...

13:59.080 --> 14:00.630
That's because

14:00.910 --> 14:02.750
he attended a local school

14:02.960 --> 14:03.270
and...

14:04.000 --> 14:05.320
was a classmate of my son.

14:05.790 --> 14:08.630
He brought back a few gifts for my son.

14:09.270 --> 14:09.670
But

14:10.120 --> 14:13.270
he never revealed his official position
to me.

14:13.630 --> 14:16.840
Otherwise, I would've made arrangements
much sooner.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.080
That doesn't matter now.

14:23.000 --> 14:23.630
At least

14:24.390 --> 14:26.720
your son seems to know him quite well.

14:27.550 --> 14:29.320
With that connection,

14:29.790 --> 14:32.870
he still has to treat you with respect.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.840
Surely he'll show you
some consideration.

14:35.790 --> 14:36.480
Prefect Liu.

14:44.320 --> 14:46.240
The longer he stays here,

14:46.720 --> 14:48.000
the more people he'll implicate,

14:48.840 --> 14:49.390
and things

14:50.270 --> 14:51.720
will only get harder to control.

14:53.320 --> 14:54.030
Surely

14:55.120 --> 14:56.200
you understand that.

14:58.960 --> 14:59.720
Wei Feng

15:00.200 --> 15:02.120
is your most trusted right-hand man.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.960
If he dares summon Wei Feng,

15:08.480 --> 15:09.510
who's next?

15:14.320 --> 15:16.120
Before things get out of hand,

15:16.630 --> 15:18.200
you'd better put an end to this.

15:19.600 --> 15:20.600
Understood, sir.

15:23.120 --> 15:23.720
One more thing.

15:26.080 --> 15:27.120
A dog won't let go

15:28.150 --> 15:30.030
unless you give it some meat.

15:31.960 --> 15:32.910
Yan Shang

15:34.000 --> 15:34.910
has climbed so high

15:35.630 --> 15:37.120
in just a few months.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.720
He must be quite calculating

15:41.440 --> 15:42.630
and ruthless.

15:45.360 --> 15:46.240
You mean...

15:48.000 --> 15:48.870
If necessary,

15:50.200 --> 15:51.960
throw him a few bones to keep him quiet.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.030
For instance,

15:57.440 --> 15:59.120
if you can't save Wei Feng,

16:00.240 --> 16:01.240
hand him over.

16:02.480 --> 16:03.270
As for the others,

16:04.670 --> 16:05.720
use your judgment.

16:19.120 --> 16:19.480
Yes, sir.

16:20.080 --> 16:25.840
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

16:25.840 --> 16:26.200
Sir!

16:27.390 --> 16:27.720
Sir!

16:34.390 --> 16:35.270
If I can't

16:36.510 --> 16:38.150
get this situation under control,

16:40.670 --> 16:42.630
I'll become a pawn

16:46.630 --> 16:48.320
he can sacrifice whenever he pleases.

16:49.960 --> 16:50.240
Then...

16:51.240 --> 16:52.440
what do you plan to do, sir?

17:01.630 --> 17:03.120
Tomorrow,

17:05.440 --> 17:07.030
we'll host a grand banquet here.

17:08.440 --> 17:08.790
Yes.

17:10.060 --> 17:14.890
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

17:14.940 --> 17:19.820
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

17:41.270 --> 17:41.550
This way, please.

18:11.720 --> 18:14.000
When you visited my residence
the other day, Mr. Yan,

18:14.240 --> 18:15.680
I was unfortunately occupied
with urgent business

18:15.830 --> 18:17.920
and couldn't invite you in
for a proper conversation.

18:18.680 --> 18:20.400
I've arranged today's banquet

18:20.830 --> 18:21.830
to make it up to you.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.720
You're all my seniors.

18:25.110 --> 18:26.070
Making you wait

18:26.350 --> 18:27.590
was rude of me, not you.

18:29.590 --> 18:30.310
Please, have a seat.

18:30.720 --> 18:31.000
After you.

18:31.350 --> 18:31.640
Please.

18:43.440 --> 18:44.480
Mr. Yan,

18:45.160 --> 18:46.440
since you're a Circuit Inspector,

18:47.110 --> 18:49.000
why didn't you tell me the other day?

18:49.750 --> 18:51.160
I owe you an apology.

18:52.750 --> 18:54.270
That was my mistake.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.110
To tell you the truth,

18:57.640 --> 18:59.350
I'm from Lingnan myself.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.510
I only traveled north
for the examinations last year.

19:02.110 --> 19:04.160
Now that I'm home, meeting
officials who govern my homeland

19:04.590 --> 19:05.030
makes me feel

19:05.750 --> 19:06.590
(Yinbin Hall)
right at home.

19:07.400 --> 19:09.830
Besides, Prefect Liu and I
go back a long way.

19:10.440 --> 19:12.440
And you're all
his longtime subordinates.

19:12.920 --> 19:13.440
So, really,

19:14.000 --> 19:14.720
fate has brought us together.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.480
We're all among friends here.

19:19.720 --> 19:21.030
But Mr. Yan,

19:22.310 --> 19:23.510
as soon as you arrived,

19:24.240 --> 19:26.440
you started summoning officials
for questioning.

19:26.590 --> 19:29.680
Now everyone in Lingnan is on edge.

19:30.830 --> 19:31.790
It almost seems

19:32.240 --> 19:35.200
you're trying to put me in my place.

19:41.750 --> 19:43.590
(Yinbin Hall)
Prefect Liu, Senior Secretary Wei,

19:44.550 --> 19:46.160
since we're all gathered here today,

19:46.960 --> 19:47.480
I'll

19:48.270 --> 19:49.880
get straight to the point.

19:53.480 --> 19:54.160
His Majesty

19:54.750 --> 19:56.400
intends to restore order
throughout the empire.

19:56.720 --> 19:59.240
He appointed me Circuit Inspector
to investigate Lingnan.

20:00.070 --> 20:00.790
Think about it.

20:02.110 --> 20:03.070
Why would he do that?

20:04.940 --> 20:07.580
(Yinbin Hall)

20:11.400 --> 20:14.110
Why make Lingnan his first target?

20:15.160 --> 20:16.960
Surely there's a reason.

20:19.960 --> 20:21.240
If His Majesty has grown suspicious,

20:21.350 --> 20:21.880
he must

20:22.680 --> 20:24.310
have heard some troubling rumors.

20:39.000 --> 20:41.550
What do you intend to do, Mr. Yan?

20:42.750 --> 20:43.640
Please, speak plainly.

20:47.550 --> 20:49.310
His Majesty specifically sent me here.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.240
Can I really

20:51.830 --> 20:53.720
return empty-handed and say,

20:54.270 --> 20:55.510
"I found absolutely nothing"?

20:58.880 --> 20:59.590
Gentlemen,

21:00.270 --> 21:01.920
surely you must give me something

21:02.030 --> 21:03.510
to report to His Majesty.

21:06.510 --> 21:07.030
Prefect Liu,

21:08.160 --> 21:09.919
I'm not a stubborn man

21:09.961 --> 21:11.031
who refuses to compromise.

21:11.790 --> 21:15.200
I'd gladly put in a good word
for all of you before His Majesty.

21:15.920 --> 21:16.480
So,

21:16.960 --> 21:18.480
I'll need your cooperation.

21:19.270 --> 21:20.880
Don't leave me standing
before His Majesty

21:21.640 --> 21:22.920
with no answers to give.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.510
Then what exactly

21:32.270 --> 21:32.830
do you want to know?

21:38.640 --> 21:39.680
I already have

21:40.750 --> 21:42.070
the financial records of one county.

21:43.440 --> 21:44.750
By my rough calculations,

21:45.110 --> 21:46.160
across the entire Lingnan Circuit,

21:47.200 --> 21:49.510
I'm afraid there are
at least ten million strings of coins

21:50.400 --> 21:51.310
have likely gone missing.

22:03.960 --> 22:04.400
Am I right?

22:09.550 --> 22:10.240
Right now,

22:11.070 --> 22:12.000
I'm the only one

22:12.510 --> 22:13.920
who can protect you
from the consequences.

22:14.790 --> 22:15.680
But first,

22:16.110 --> 22:17.750
I need to know exactly

22:18.110 --> 22:18.830
what I'm covering up.

22:26.920 --> 22:27.440
Prefect Liu,

22:29.270 --> 22:31.310
where are Lingnan Circuit's

22:33.310 --> 22:34.030
real financial records?

23:06.070 --> 23:06.790
What is it?

23:09.070 --> 23:10.110
Word from the military governor's
residence.

23:10.830 --> 23:11.790
This man works for the Crown Prince.

23:26.960 --> 23:28.270
I've given it some thought.

23:30.110 --> 23:31.790
What you've said, Mr. Yan,

23:32.830 --> 23:34.480
is truly sincere and heartfelt.

23:36.790 --> 23:38.030
So I suppose

23:39.070 --> 23:40.350
I ought to

23:41.110 --> 23:42.680
show you the same sincerity.

23:47.680 --> 23:49.590
Bring me all the financial ledgers.

23:49.960 --> 23:50.310
Yes, sir.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.600
(Financial Ledgers)

24:02.640 --> 24:06.270
Here's the information you wanted,
Mr. Yan.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.270
Much obliged.

24:11.920 --> 24:12.350
However,

24:14.160 --> 24:15.240
you may only examine them here.

24:18.350 --> 24:18.720
Very well.

24:19.110 --> 24:21.089
You'll need something to report
to His Majesty.

24:21.131 --> 24:22.531
I understand completely.

24:22.880 --> 24:23.590
Therefore,

24:24.750 --> 24:26.480
I'll draw up a list of names.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.960
You may deal with anyone on that list.

24:29.310 --> 24:32.640
As for everyone else,
I ask you to show mercy

24:32.750 --> 24:34.000
and keep the investigation contained.

24:36.480 --> 24:37.200
Of course.

24:38.780 --> 24:40.420
(Lianshan County Financial Ledger,
20th Year of Yingxiang)

24:47.220 --> 24:48.860
(Household Registration Records)

25:07.860 --> 25:10.500
(Ledger: Land Acreage by Category
and Individual Allotment)

25:56.860 --> 25:57.900
(Ledger: Land Acreage by Category
and Individual Allotment)

26:30.550 --> 26:32.000
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)
Thank you all for today.

26:32.510 --> 26:33.240
Thank you, Prefect Liu.

26:33.680 --> 26:35.070
I'm truly grateful.

26:36.070 --> 26:38.000
We're the ones who should thank you,
Mr. Yan.

26:38.480 --> 26:40.550
Escort Mr. Yan safely
back to his residence.

26:41.960 --> 26:42.590
No need to see me out.

26:43.350 --> 26:43.750
Farewell.

26:50.790 --> 26:51.270
Yan Shang!

27:10.160 --> 27:12.200
That's the military governor's carriage.

27:20.920 --> 27:21.720
What are you doing here?

27:25.510 --> 27:27.510
I'm on my way to Mount Lufu
to pray and happened to pass by.

27:28.550 --> 27:28.960
What?

27:29.880 --> 27:30.830
Do I need your permission?

27:53.780 --> 27:56.420
(Bamboo Goods; Rice Cakes)

28:03.110 --> 28:04.790
I sent Fang Tong to speak
with Jiang Heng.

28:05.400 --> 28:07.110
You nearly got yourself killed!
Do you realize that?

28:08.440 --> 28:09.030
I know.

28:12.000 --> 28:12.510
It's all right.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.270
Have mercy!

28:26.790 --> 28:27.880
Please spare us some food!

28:33.640 --> 28:34.640
Why don't we look around?

28:35.200 --> 28:36.270
Would Your Highness do me the honor?

28:41.880 --> 28:42.310
Stop the carriage!

28:48.200 --> 28:49.270
I'll accompany Her Highness
to do some shopping.

28:49.680 --> 28:50.680
You may return and report back.

28:50.960 --> 28:51.270
Yes, sir.

28:56.940 --> 28:57.780
(Wontons)

28:59.540 --> 29:00.580
(Rice Cakes)

29:10.020 --> 29:11.260
(Shuying Rouge House; Scented Powder)

29:14.750 --> 29:15.310
Let's have a look inside.

29:18.140 --> 29:19.980
(Rice Cakes)

29:20.100 --> 29:21.540
(Wontons)

29:22.300 --> 29:24.860
(Shuying Rouge House)

29:31.110 --> 29:32.160
What can I show you two?

29:34.640 --> 29:36.350
This young gentleman...

29:38.310 --> 29:39.510
You're a returning customer!

29:39.880 --> 29:41.750
You came last year to learn
how to make rouge, didn't you?

29:42.590 --> 29:44.070
I'd never forget a face!

29:45.240 --> 29:46.350
Congratulations, young man.

29:46.640 --> 29:48.270
Looks like you won the lady's heart.

29:49.000 --> 29:49.680
Thanks to you.

29:52.110 --> 29:53.310
What a lovely young lady!

29:53.880 --> 29:55.480
Would you like to see our new lip rouge?

29:55.790 --> 29:56.110
Sure.

29:57.790 --> 29:58.200
Wait.

29:59.680 --> 30:00.440
Not just lip rouge.

30:01.000 --> 30:03.590
Bring out your new face powder,
eyebrow powder, and forehead ornaments.

30:03.960 --> 30:04.640
I'd like to see them all.

30:05.790 --> 30:07.000
Of course! Just a moment!

30:15.160 --> 30:16.030
Congratulations.

30:18.750 --> 30:19.440
For what?

30:20.440 --> 30:21.640
Becoming a Circuit Inspector.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.480
Quite an impressive position,

30:23.750 --> 30:24.270
Yan Shang.

30:27.070 --> 30:28.310
What is he using to threaten you?

30:30.030 --> 30:30.590
Your father?

30:34.070 --> 30:34.680
Your family?

30:40.160 --> 30:40.550
Me?

30:46.110 --> 30:46.640
So,

30:47.160 --> 30:48.270
what exactly have you uncovered?

30:51.110 --> 30:51.920
First, tell me

30:52.440 --> 30:53.680
what you said to Jiang Heng

30:55.240 --> 30:56.310
to make him spare my life.

31:03.350 --> 31:04.200
Did you tell him

31:05.680 --> 31:07.680
that I'm secretly working
for the Crown Prince, just like him?

31:10.550 --> 31:11.110
It seems

31:12.350 --> 31:13.240
you've finished your investigation.

31:16.160 --> 31:16.720
Last night,

31:18.000 --> 31:18.830
at Prefect Liu's residence,

31:20.030 --> 31:20.619
I saw

31:20.661 --> 31:22.461
records of every payment
they sent to the Crown Prince.

31:28.510 --> 31:29.880
And I have you to thank for helping me.

31:35.480 --> 31:35.960
Yan Shang!

31:50.200 --> 31:51.200
Across the entire Lingnan Circuit,

31:51.790 --> 31:53.440
all 24 prefectures and 93 counties,

31:54.200 --> 31:56.200
money squeezed from the people
through oppressive taxes,

31:57.030 --> 31:58.400
even the recent disaster relief funds,

31:59.200 --> 32:00.920
mostly ended up in the Crown Prince's
pockets.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.310
The person His Majesty
wants to bring down

32:05.310 --> 32:06.240
is the Crown Prince.

32:12.440 --> 32:13.070
So,

32:14.680 --> 32:15.720
that's why he sent you to Lingnan.

32:25.240 --> 32:25.750
Yan Shang,

32:27.880 --> 32:29.000
you told me before

32:30.680 --> 32:31.680
that you wanted to go to Sheng'an

32:32.440 --> 32:33.790
to study at the Imperial Academy.

32:34.960 --> 32:36.200
That was the first time you lied to me.

32:36.920 --> 32:37.480
This time,

32:38.350 --> 32:39.160
you told me

32:39.720 --> 32:40.590
you came to Lingnan

32:41.680 --> 32:43.310
because you'd requested leave
to visit your family.

32:46.270 --> 32:47.070
That's twice now!

32:48.270 --> 32:49.200
I'm warning you.

32:49.830 --> 32:50.830
Three strikes, and you're out.

32:59.750 --> 33:00.440
You two.

33:01.110 --> 33:02.110
Come take a look, you two.

33:09.070 --> 33:10.350
Come on, take a look!

33:11.110 --> 33:13.160
These are our latest cosmetics.

33:13.550 --> 33:15.720
We've got forehead ornaments, rouge,
and lip rouge!

33:16.000 --> 33:16.510
Have a look!

33:27.790 --> 33:28.400
Young man,

33:29.030 --> 33:31.030
this eyebrow powder is all the rage.

33:31.310 --> 33:32.400
Why not let your girl try it?

34:16.840 --> 34:17.510
(Serene and Content)
I'm done playing.

34:18.320 --> 34:19.070
Your Majesty...

34:21.670 --> 34:23.190
Your mind is elsewhere.

34:25.550 --> 34:26.030
Yes.

34:27.070 --> 34:28.000
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

34:29.440 --> 34:30.360
What's on your mind?

34:31.320 --> 34:32.880
I wouldn't lie to Your Majesty.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.670
I'm thinking about a former student.

34:39.840 --> 34:41.030
By my reckoning,

34:42.000 --> 34:43.030
he should have been in Lingnan

34:43.510 --> 34:45.000
for several days now.

34:47.360 --> 34:48.150
Your Majesty,

34:49.710 --> 34:52.030
(Serene and Content)
he once told me

34:52.960 --> 34:54.150
that if he entered public service,

34:54.280 --> 34:56.400
he would punish the wicked
and bring peace to the realm.

34:57.190 --> 34:58.190
It seems

34:58.440 --> 35:00.670
he truly has the talent

35:00.880 --> 35:02.630
and the ambition to do so.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.550
What a pity.

35:08.510 --> 35:10.070
A pity he was born in troubled times.

35:12.030 --> 35:13.259
In an age of peace and prosperity,

35:13.301 --> 35:15.941
he might become a chancellor
who brings the empire to greatness.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.710
But in times like these,

35:19.670 --> 35:20.760
with the court as it is,

35:22.550 --> 35:25.110
the whole edifice is crumbling,
and one man cannot save it.

35:27.440 --> 35:28.880
He can only serve as a blade,

35:29.630 --> 35:30.880
worn down until it breaks.

35:33.280 --> 35:33.960
Your Majesty...

35:34.190 --> 35:37.320
If we're to put his talents
and ambition to good use,

35:37.920 --> 35:39.000
the best place for him

35:39.710 --> 35:40.590
is Lingnan,

35:41.230 --> 35:44.190
where he can clash
with my dear son, the Crown Prince.

35:45.510 --> 35:47.480
Either one will crush the other,

35:48.190 --> 35:48.710
or

35:50.230 --> 35:51.510
they'll destroy each other.

35:59.480 --> 36:02.280
Since Your Majesty has already decided

36:02.880 --> 36:06.630
to use Yan Shang to cut out the rot
in Lingnan,

36:07.800 --> 36:10.230
why did you let Princess Danyang
go there too?

36:11.030 --> 36:12.440
To protect Yan Shang,

36:13.190 --> 36:14.360
Her Highness

36:14.630 --> 36:19.030
will surely do everything
she can to stop his investigation.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.049
Such a fine blade...

36:23.091 --> 36:25.341
If it breaks in Lingnan
after just one use,

36:25.440 --> 36:27.760
even I would consider that a waste.

36:28.920 --> 36:30.400
Wanyao is a clever girl.

36:31.110 --> 36:33.710
Perhaps she can help him
come back alive.

36:34.670 --> 36:36.760
With a little more sharpening,

36:38.590 --> 36:40.760
the blade can be used again.

36:45.960 --> 36:46.760
(Shuying Rouge House)
Come again!

37:00.030 --> 37:00.960
They're still following us.

37:03.110 --> 37:03.550
Follow me.

37:14.940 --> 37:15.780
(Flatbread)

37:16.220 --> 37:17.460
(Wang's Tea Shop)

37:40.590 --> 37:41.000
Where'd they go?

37:41.590 --> 37:41.960
This way!

37:57.070 --> 37:57.880
This is a nice spot.

37:58.920 --> 37:59.960
You certainly know where to go.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.670
This is my hometown, after all.

38:05.110 --> 38:05.920
What are you going to do?

38:08.670 --> 38:09.550
Do His Majesty's bidding

38:10.630 --> 38:11.480
and bring down the Crown Prince?

38:14.480 --> 38:15.190
Do you realize

38:16.280 --> 38:17.190
that if you do this,

38:18.030 --> 38:19.000
the Crown Prince won't be

38:19.630 --> 38:20.590
the only one facing ruin?

38:22.760 --> 38:23.280
Your Highness,

38:25.150 --> 38:26.280
you can wash your hands of all this

38:27.320 --> 38:28.190
and retreat to safety.

38:28.670 --> 38:29.670
But I won't!

38:32.110 --> 38:32.590
Yan Shang,

38:33.110 --> 38:33.710
you know

38:34.960 --> 38:36.230
how much I risked

38:36.760 --> 38:37.510
to secretly meet

38:37.920 --> 38:38.880
military commanders
for the Crown Prince.

38:39.320 --> 38:39.960
You also know

38:40.320 --> 38:42.960
how much time and effort I spent

38:43.510 --> 38:44.800
winning those officers over.

38:45.320 --> 38:46.590
They're not just loyal
to the Crown Prince.

38:47.030 --> 38:47.920
They're loyal to me too.

38:49.190 --> 38:50.030
Someday, I'll need them

38:50.550 --> 38:51.800
to protect myself.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.190
Must you really take away

38:55.920 --> 38:57.760
the support I worked so hard to build?

38:59.030 --> 39:00.360
Your Highness, on your way here,

39:02.070 --> 39:04.030
did you see what Lingnan has become?

39:10.110 --> 39:11.070
Fields lie abandoned.

39:14.480 --> 39:15.360
Families are torn apart.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.320
There are hungry, destitute children,

39:20.920 --> 39:23.030
far more than in Sheng'an's Infirmary.

39:32.670 --> 39:33.190
This

39:34.030 --> 39:35.280
is my home.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.400
Before I came here,

39:41.630 --> 39:44.000
I had no idea they'd brought Lingnan
to such ruin.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.480
Otherwise,

39:46.230 --> 39:47.760
do you think I'd have stood by
and done nothing?

39:48.000 --> 39:48.630
I believe you.

39:50.670 --> 39:51.880
I believe you didn't know.

39:53.030 --> 39:54.320
Then keep believing in me.

39:56.280 --> 39:58.110
Believe that one day,

39:59.110 --> 40:00.320
I'll have the power

40:01.150 --> 40:02.190
to restore military discipline,

40:02.760 --> 40:03.590
cut out the corruption,

40:04.440 --> 40:05.440
and root out

40:06.230 --> 40:07.110
these long-standing abuses.

40:13.230 --> 40:14.000
But Your Highness,

40:15.840 --> 40:16.710
the officials here

40:17.670 --> 40:19.419
have been imposing crushing taxes
and exploiting the people

40:19.461 --> 40:20.901
for countless years.

40:22.840 --> 40:24.070
It didn't start with the Crown Prince,

40:25.280 --> 40:26.339
or with Yu Cheng'an,

40:26.381 --> 40:28.421
or even with the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors.

40:30.590 --> 40:31.000
This place

40:33.280 --> 40:34.760
is rotten to the core.

40:37.360 --> 40:38.510
People die here every day.

40:39.110 --> 40:40.550
Every year, the land is littered
with victims of starvation.

40:43.190 --> 40:43.630
Your Highness,

40:45.840 --> 40:46.630
what this place needs

40:48.280 --> 40:49.670
is swift, decisive justice

40:51.070 --> 40:52.070
to root out

40:53.320 --> 40:54.400
every trace of corruption.

40:54.590 --> 40:56.280
Are you going to root me out too?

41:07.760 --> 41:08.320
Yan Shang,

41:09.550 --> 41:10.230
promise me.

41:12.920 --> 41:14.150
You found nothing here.

41:17.070 --> 41:18.440
Forget everything that happened here.

41:19.880 --> 41:20.360
Yan Shang,

41:21.920 --> 41:22.920
one day,

41:23.960 --> 41:24.880
I'll set things right

41:26.360 --> 41:27.550
in my own way.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.630
Trust me.

41:34.030 --> 41:34.920
Promise me.

41:45.550 --> 41:46.000
All right.

41:47.460 --> 41:49.090
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

41:49.140 --> 41:51.880
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

41:51.930 --> 41:54.050
♪You're the only one I need♪

41:54.710 --> 42:01.480
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

42:01.860 --> 42:04.980
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

42:05.390 --> 42:07.270
♪My last untouched innocence♪

42:12.550 --> 42:13.510
That's an order.

42:14.760 --> 42:15.280
You're coming

42:16.030 --> 42:16.920
back to Sheng'an with me right now.

42:20.400 --> 42:21.760
What about your escort and attendants?

42:22.230 --> 42:23.150
I only brought Fang Tong.

42:23.880 --> 42:25.110
Jiang Heng has kept him
at his residence.

42:25.920 --> 42:26.800
We've agreed

42:27.510 --> 42:28.590
to leave separately.

42:29.630 --> 42:31.400
I've hired a carriage
from a local merchant.

42:31.630 --> 42:32.320
It's waiting at the city gate.

42:32.960 --> 42:33.710
I told them

42:34.320 --> 42:36.320
I'm taking my husband north
to visit my family.

42:37.000 --> 42:37.550
When we get there,

42:38.070 --> 42:40.150
speak a little of the local dialect
to the driver.

42:48.440 --> 42:48.960
Looks like

42:50.510 --> 42:51.800
you've thought of everything.

42:56.550 --> 42:57.000
Wanyao,

42:57.920 --> 42:58.800
before we leave,

43:00.550 --> 43:01.760
come home with me to say goodbye.

43:07.400 --> 43:09.110
Shang, why so suddenly?

43:09.480 --> 43:10.880
You just got back,
and now you're leaving?

43:11.400 --> 43:13.070
Didn't you promise to stay?

43:15.510 --> 43:16.760
I'll come back to visit whenever I can.

43:29.920 --> 43:30.440
Xiaozhou,

43:31.710 --> 43:32.510
take care of yourself,

43:33.000 --> 43:34.550
and look after our elder brother
and Father.

43:53.840 --> 43:54.550
Father.

43:57.670 --> 43:58.320
Take care!

44:53.090 --> 44:57.690
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

44:58.190 --> 45:01.390
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

45:02.360 --> 45:07.390
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

45:07.760 --> 45:10.990
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

45:11.710 --> 45:12.400
Shang!

45:12.670 --> 45:13.400
Shang!

45:13.920 --> 45:14.510
Shang!

45:14.552 --> 45:15.430
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

45:15.480 --> 45:16.190
Shang!

45:17.360 --> 45:19.360
Take good care of yourself, Shang!

45:19.402 --> 45:20.490
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

45:21.890 --> 45:27.070
♪Tread the boundless clouds
and rise with the wind♪

45:27.500 --> 45:30.310
♪March to the gates
with fearless hearts♪

45:32.820 --> 45:37.560
♪Break every gate♪

45:38.980 --> 45:43.220
(Next Episode Preview)

45:44.280 --> 45:44.590
What's wrong?

45:45.280 --> 45:46.550
Hoofbeats are approaching.

45:47.110 --> 45:47.920
Horses moving that fast

45:48.360 --> 45:49.480
aren't privately owned.

45:51.110 --> 45:51.840
This coachman is up to something!

45:52.190 --> 45:52.630
Hold on tight!

46:00.161 --> 46:03.454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:06.139 --> 46:11.055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:13.249 --> 46:19.094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:19.594 --> 46:24.820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:27.589 --> 46:32.380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:33.216 --> 46:39.295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:41.096 --> 46:44.246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:44.246 --> 46:45.894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:45.946 --> 46:49.670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:50.048 --> 46:54.714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:55.333 --> 46:59.374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:59.865 --> 47:01.980
♪Not a single hour less♪

47:02.020 --> 47:08.966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:09.729 --> 47:13.182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:13.362 --> 47:16.507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:16.946 --> 47:23.583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:23.980 --> 47:26.018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:26.018 --> 47:28.494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:28.532 --> 47:31.001
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:31.205 --> 47:38.092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:38.404 --> 47:41.675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:41.980 --> 47:45.153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:45.477 --> 47:48.903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:49.136 --> 47:52.361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:52.692 --> 47:59.488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:59.857 --> 48:01.919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:01.920 --> 48:04.423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:04.470 --> 48:06.808
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:07.039 --> 48:13.874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:14.223 --> 48:15.841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:15.971 --> 48:17.767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:18.124 --> 48:21.141
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:21.181 --> 48:22.508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
